 roguelike Auto-Battler adventure<br></li><li>Ranked and unranked PVP<br></li><li>Over 200 items<br></li><li>Over 200 perks<br></li><li>Over 100 Units<br></li><li>Unique Trait synergies<br></li><li>15 Difficulty Tiers to climb<br></li><li>Custom Difficulty<br></li><li>“At Your Pace” unlock system</li></ul>", "short_description": "Roguelike Squad-based Autobattler in a Tabletop RPG setting. Draft your army, carefully equip and position your units, make important choices, and meet a colorful cast of characters as you make ready for the Grand Tournament.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“&quot;Tales &amp; Tactics is an incredibly dense Roguelike auto battler, that once you put the time into learning you'll never want to put down.&quot;”<br>8.5/10 – God is a Geek<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652250/header.jpg?t=1787084300", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652250/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787084300", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652250/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787084300", "website": "https://table9studio.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 1000-Series or higher (4GB+ VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Wi